  "notes": "{混|ま}ぜる is an ichidan transitive verb meaning to mix or blend.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: ⟦{他動詞|たどうし}→他動詞：10418_tadoushi⟧ (transitive)\n- Pair: ⟦{混|ま}ざる→混ざる：02420_mazaru⟧ (intransitive, to be mixed)\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- ⟦よく→よく：00601_yoku⟧{混|ま}ぜる: to mix well\n- ⟦{軽|かる}く→軽い：00785_karui⟧{混|ま}ぜる: to mix lightly\n- 〜に{混|ま}ぜる: to mix into ~\n- ⟦{仲間|なかま}→仲間：03498_nakama⟧⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧{混|ま}ぜる: to let someone join the group\n\nCOOKING USES:\n- ⟦{卵|たまご}→卵：02222_tamago⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{混|ま}ぜる: to beat eggs\n- ⟦{材料|ざいりょう}→材料：02831_zairyou⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{混|ま}ぜる: to mix ingredients\n- ⟦ヘラ→ヘラ：04472_hera⟧⟦で→で：00502_de⟧{混|ま}ぜる: to mix with a spatula\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- ⟦かき{混|ま}ぜる→かき混ぜる：15739_kakimazeru⟧: to stir (more vigorous)\n- ⟦{混|ま}ぜ{合|あ}わせる→混ぜ合わせる：27842_mazeawaseru⟧: to combine, blend together\n- ⟦{交|ま}ぜる→交ぜる：28480_mazeru⟧: alternate kanji, same meaning",
